 necesita conditii speciale de depozitare</li>\r\n<li>gestionarea termenelor de expirare se realizeaza mai usor si mai precis</li>\r\n</ul>','<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Informații generale</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Referință (SKU): 38580700E</p>\r\n<p>Descrierea produsului: 7 role xHACCP, de luni p&acirc;nă duminică</p>\r\n<p>Produs &icirc;n: UE</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Proprietăți tehnice</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Dimensiuni etichete: 58 x 38 mm</p>\r\n<p>Etichete / rolă: 670 buc.</p>\r\n<p>Cod EAN: 5944582004023</p>\r\n<p>Material: Super Vellum detașabil, fără BPA, contact cu alimente permis</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Informații logistice</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Referință (SKU): 38580700E</p>\r\n<p>Descrierea cutiei: 7 x 670 xHACCP etichete amovibile 58x38 mm</p>\r\n<p>Dimensiuni cutie: 295 x 100 x 100 mm</p>\r\n<p>Cod EAN: 5944582004023</p>\r\n<p>Greutate netă (g): 1650</p>\r\n<p>Greutate bruto (g): 1800</p>','Set 7 role etichete xHACCP zilele saptamanii','Etichete zilele saptamanii xHACCP','Set_ role etichete xHACCP'),(75,'en','Zebra TC21, 2 Pin, 2D, SE4710, USB, BT (BLE, 5.0), Wi-Fi, NFC, PTT, GMS, Android','<p>Zebra TC21, 2 Pin, 2D, SE4710, USB, BT (BLE, 5.0), Wi-Fi, NFC, PTT, GMS, Android</p>','Zebra TC21, 2 Pin, 2D, SE4710, USB, BT (BLE, 5.0), Wi-Fi, NFC, PTT, GMS, Android','<p>The durable, enterprise-class Zebra TC21 touch computer features an attractive, compact smartphone design and many practical functions for getting work done quickly in industrial environments. Wi-Fi makes it perfect for those who work in the same place all the time, and with the Android operating system and more than 50 security and data privacy enhancements, it also has an incredibly high standard of security. Additionally, the mobile computer may be configured in a variety of ways, which the user chooses according to the needs.</p>\r\n<p>The touch computer offers various options for reliable communication, including &raquo;Voice over Wi-Fi&laquo;(VoWiFi). Optionally, you may install push-to-talk (PTT) or Express (a Mobility DNA tool) on the device.</p>\r\n<p>The TC21 is equipped with a 5\" HD touchscreen, a rechargeable battery with up to 14 hours of battery life and the interfaces WLAN, Bluetooth, GPS and NFC. The integrated 5 megapixel front camera is suitable for video calls and the 13 megapixel colour camera on the rear is suitable for occasional barcode capture and detailed photo-recording &ndash; for example, to provide proof of delivery and document completed repairs or damage to delivered goods. For scan-intensive tasks, the SE4710 and SE4100 enterprise scan modules are available as an option.</p>\r\n<p>Due to its compact size and lightweight, carry the TC21 around all day effortlessly and operate it with only one hand. At the same time, the wrist strap allows users to concentrate fully on their tasks rather than on handling the device. Also, the touch computer is water- and dust-proof, easily survives multiple falls onto concrete, and even snow, rain, heat and cold do not bother it.</p>\r\n<p>The TC21 touch computer is supported by the powerful, free tools of &raquo;Mobility DNA Professional&laquo; and the optional &raquo;Zebra OneCare SV support plan&laquo;. This provides comprehensive protection by covering normal wear and tear, live and online technical support, priority repair work, and more.</p>','','Zebra TC21, 2 Pin, 2D, SE4710, USB, BT (BLE, 5.0), Wi-Fi, NFC, PTT, GMS, Android','Zebra TC21, 2 Pin, 2D, SE4710, USB, BT (BLE, 5.0), Wi-Fi, NFC, PTT, GMS, Android','Zebra TC21 Pin_ SE4710 USB_ (BLE 5.0) NFC_ PTT_ GMS_ Android'),(53,'ro','Set 8 role etichete  etichete xHACCP','<p>Etichete in rola speciale xHACCP</p>','Etichete zilele sapatamanii xHACCP + o rola pentru congelate','<ul>\r\n<li>set de 8 role de etichete xHACCP, 7 role pentru zilele saptamanii plus o rola pentru congelator</li>\r\n<li>materialul din care sunt fabricate asigura indepartarea lor usoara dupa utilizare fara sa lase urme de adeziv</li>\r\n<li>adezivul special permite contactul direct cu alimentele</li>\r\n<li>adezivul rolei pentru congelator rezista si mentine eticheta la temperaturi de congelare fara sa existe riscul caderii acesteia in timpul depozitarii</li>\r\n<li>culorile unice ale fiecarei etichete permite identificarea usoara si rapida a produselor care urmeaza sa expire.</li>\r\n<li>pot fi utilizate pe orice suprafata a recipientelor utilizate la depozitarea alimentelor</li>\r\n<li>nu necesita conditii speciale de depozitare</li>\r\n<li>gestionarea termenelor de expirare se realizeaza mai usor si mai precis</li>\r\n</ul>','<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Informații generale</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Referință (SKU): 38580800E</p>\r\n<p>Descrierea produsului: 8 role xHACCP, de luni p&acirc;nă duminică și congelator</p>\r\n<p>Produs &icirc;n: UE</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Proprietăți tehnice</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Dimensiuni etichete: 58 x 38 mm</p>\r\n<p>Etichete / rolă: 670 buc.</p>\r\n<p>Cod EAN: 5944582004016</p>\r\n<p>Material: Super Vellum detașabil, fără BPA, contact cu alimente permis</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Informații logistice</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Referință (SKU): 38580800E</p>\r\n<p>Descriere cutie: 8 x 670 xHACCP etichete 58x38 mm detașabile</p>\r\n<p>Dimensiuni cutie: 335 x 100 x 100 mm</p>\r\n<p>Cod EAN: 5944582004016</p>\r\n<p>Greutate netă (g): 1750</p>\r\n<p>Greutate Bruto (g): 1900</p>','etichete xHACCP','etichete in rola pentru restaurante','Set_ role etichete etichete xHACCP'),(76,'en','Honeywell EDA51','<p>Honeywell EDA51, 2D, SR, BT, Wi-Fi, kit (USB), GMS, black, Android</p>','Honeywell EDA51, 2D, SR, BT, Wi-Fi, kit (USB), GMS, black, Android','<p>The Honeywell full touch mobile terminal EDA51 is equipped with a 5\'\' multi-touch display and a powerful exchangeable battery and is therefore ideal for small businesses in retail, transportation, logistics and field service. Honeywell has equipped the full touch mobile terminal with the Android operating system, and supports your customers with updates and support up to versions P and Q. What does this mean for your customers? Less integration effort reduced costs and more flexibility. Plus, the ScanPal EDA51 is compatible with the accessories, batteries and charging stations of the EDA50.</p>\r\n<p>Thanks to an integrated barcode scanner with fast N6603 slim imager technology, capturing common 1D and 2D barcodes is very easy with the EDA51. An SDM450 octa-core 1.8 GHz processor, 2 GB of RAM and 16 GB flash memory ensure for outstanding job performance. The connectivity of the EDA51 will also impress: Wi-Fi (802.11a/b/g/n/ac), LTE, GSM &amp; EDGE 2/3/5/8, Bluetooth 4.2, NFC, USB and optional WWAN. The full touch mobile terminal is IP64-certified and impact-resistant from 1.2 m.</p>','<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></span><br /><em>Housing Grade:&nbsp;</em>Standard<br /><em>Features:&nbsp;</em>Rugged<br /><em>Camera:&nbsp;</em>Yes<br /><em>Application:&nbsp;</em>Retail, Field Service</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>DIMENSIONS</strong></span><br /><em>Overall Dimensions:&nbsp;</em>15.7 x 7.82 x 1.69 cm / 6.18 x 3.08 x 0.67 in</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SOFTWARE &amp; FIRMWARE</strong></span><br /><em>Operating System:&nbsp;</em>Android 8</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>MEMORY &amp; DATA</strong></span><br /><em>Memory:&nbsp;</em>16 GB Flash/2 GB RAM</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>HARDWARE</strong></span><br /><em>Processor:&nbsp;</em>Qualcomm Snapdragon SDM450, 1.8 GHz octa-core<br /><em>Display Size:&nbsp;</em>5 in / 12.7 cm<br /><em>Display Resolution:&nbsp;</em>1280 x 720</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>ENVIRONMENTAL</strong></span><br /><em>Storage Temperature Range:&nbsp;</em>- 20 - 70 &deg;C / - 4 - 158 &deg;F<br /><em>Operating Temperature:&nbsp;</em>- 10 - 50 &deg;C / 14 - 122 &deg;F<br /><em>Operating Humidity:</em>10 - 90 %</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>STANDARDS &amp; APPROVALS</strong></span><br /><em><strong>T</strong>umble Specifications:&nbsp;</em>300 times at 0.5 m (1.64 ft)<br /><em>Drop Specifications:&nbsp;</em>Multiple 1.2 m (4 ft) drops to concrete at room temperature</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SERVICE TERMS</strong></span><br /><em>Warranty Duration:&nbsp;</em>1 yr</li>\r\n</ul>','Honeywell EDA51','Honeywell EDA51, 2D, SR, BT, Wi-Fi, kit (USB), GMS, black, Android','Honeywell EDA51'),(54,'ro','Etichete','','','','','Categorie1','','Etichete'),(55,'ro','Software','','','','','Software','software restaurant, termen de valabilitatesoftware etichete','Software'),(57,'ro','Multumim','','','','','Multumim','','Multumim'),(91,'ro','xHACCP - aplicatie software pentru bucatarii - Pret abonament lunar','','Monitorizare temperatura in congelatoare si frigidere','<p>Functionalitati de baza</p>\r\n<p>1. Printarea etichetelor xHACCP de valabilitate a produselor din bucatarie</p>\r\n<p>2. Monitorizare temperatura din frigidere, congelatoare, camere de frig si listarea graficelor de temperatura</p>\r\n<p>3. Monitorizarea termenelor de valabilitate a tuturor produselor din nomenclator</p>\r\n<p>4. Generare liste de predare-primire gestiune, intre schimburi</p>\r\n<p>5. Generare rapoarte de scoatere din evidenta a produselor expirate</p>\r\n<p>6. Generare rapoarte de productie</p>\r\n<p>7. Functie de scanare orice tip de cod QR pentru trasabilitatea ingredientelor din bucatarie</p>\r\n<p>8. Asociere imagine foto la fiecare articol receptionat in stoc</p>\r\n<p>9. Optiune de listare alergeni si/sau continut caloric, la fiecare produs din nomenclator (materii prime sau produse finite)</p>\r\n<p>* ATENTIE pretul reprezinta valoarea abonamentului lunar</p>','','xHACCP - software urmarire si gestionare termene de expirare in bucatarii','175','xHACCP aplicatie software pentru bucatarii Pret abonament lunar'),(59,'ro','Aparatura','','','','','Imprimante','','Aparatura'),(60,'ro','Set 4 role etichete xHACCP - Joi','<p>Etichete zilele saptamanii xHACCP - Joi</p>','Etichete zilele saptamanii xHACCP - Joi','<ul>\r\n<li>set de 4 role de etichete xHACCP - JOI</li>\r\n<li>materialul din care sunt fabricate asigura indepartarea lor usoara dupa utilizare fara sa lase urme de adeziv</li>\r\n<li>adezivul special permite contactul direct cu alimentele</li>\r\n<li>culorea unica a etichetei, permite identificarea usoara si rapida a produselor care au fost etichetate JOI.</li>\r\n<li>pot fi utilizate pe orice suprafata a recipientelor utilizate la depozitarea alimentelor</li>\r\n<li>nu necesita conditii speciale de depozitare</li>\r\n<li>gestionarea termenelor de expirare se realizeaza mai usor si mai precis</li>\r\n</ul>','<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Informatii generale</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Numar referinta(SKU): 38580404E</p>\r\n<p>Descriere produs: 4 role xHACCP, MIERCURI</p>\r\n<p>Produs in:&nbsp;EU</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Proprietati tehnice</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Dimensiunea etichetelor: 58 x 38 mm</p>\r\n<p>Etichete/rola: 670 pcs.</p>\r\n<p>Cod EAN : 5944582004061</p>\r\n<p>Material :&nbsp;Super Vellum usor de indepartat nu contine Phenol A, poate intra in contact direct cu alimentele.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Informatii logistice</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Numar referinta(SKU): 38580404E</p>\r\n<p>Descriere cutie:&nbsp;4 role x 670 buc. xHACCP etichete 58x38 mm</p>\r\n<p>Dimensiuni cutie :&nbsp;165 x 100 x 100 mm</p>\r\n<p>Cod EAN : 5944582004061</p>\r\n<p>Greutate neta(g):&nbsp;850</p>\r\n<p>Greutate bruta (g):&nbsp;1000</p>','Set 4 role etichete xHA