ference number (SKU): 38580406E</p>\r\n<p>Box description: 4 rolls x 670 pcs. xHACCP labels 58x38 mm</p>\r\n<p>Box dimensions: 165 x 100 x 100 mm</p>\r\n<p>EAN code: 5944582004085</p>\r\n<p>Net weight (g): 850</p>\r\n<p>Gross weight (g): 1000</p>','Set 4 role etichete xHACCP - Sambata','Etichete zilele saptamanii xHACCP - Sambata','Set_ rolls xHACCP labels SATURDAY'),(64,'en','Set of 4 xHACCP label rolls - Freezing','<p>Labels days of the week xHACCP - Freezing</p>','Etichete xHACCP - Congelare','<ul>\r\n<li>set of 4 rolls of xHACCP labels - FREEZING</li>\r\n<li>the material from which they are made ensures superior adhesion at low temperatures</li>\r\n<li>the special adhesive allows direct contact with food</li>\r\n<li>freezing resistance, allows easy and fast identification of products that have been labeled even after several months of use.</li>\r\n<li>can be used on any surface of containers used for food storage, or directly on the bags of products that are placed in the freezer</li>\r\n<li>does not require special storage conditions</li>\r\n<li>managing expiration dates is easier and more accurate</li>\r\n</ul>','<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>General information</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Reference number (SKU): 38580408E</p>\r\n<p>Product description: 4 rolls xHACCP, FREEZING</p>\r\n<p>Produced in: EU</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Technical properties</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Label size: 58 x 38 mm</p>\r\n<p>Labels / roll: 670 pcs.</p>\r\n<p>EAN code: 5944582004092</p>\r\n<p>Material: Super Vellum easy to remove does not contain Phenol A, can come into direct contact with food.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Logistic information</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Reference number (SKU): 38580408E</p>\r\n<p>Box description: 4 rolls x 670 pcs. xHACCP labels 58x38 mm</p>\r\n<p>Box dimensions: 165 x 100 x 100 mm</p>\r\n<p>EAN code: 5944582004092</p>\r\n<p>Net weight (g): 850</p>\r\n<p>Gross weight (g): 1000</p>','Set 4 role etichete xHACCP - Congelare','Etichete xHACCP - Congelare','Set_ xHACCP label rolls Freezing'),(67,'ro','POS all-in-one P1000 Colormetrics','<p>POS all-in-one pentru bugete mici și cerințe mari</p>','POS all-in-one pentru bugete mici și cerințe mari','<p>Fiind un sistem multifuncțional complet pentru zonele POS cu un buget redus, P1000 de la Colormetrics &icirc;ndeplinește fără efort standarde ridicate de calitate și performanță. Acesta combină un preț uimitor de scăzut cu un design care impresionează at&acirc;t angajații, c&acirc;t și clienții, at&acirc;t &icirc;n ​​retail, c&acirc;t și &icirc;n ospitalitate.</p>\r\n<p>Toate intrările și afișajele P1000 sunt realizate pe ecranul tactil. Rezoluția de 1.024 x 768 pixeli și dimensiunea ecranului de 15 \"asigură faptul că tot conținutul afișat este ușor de recunoscut - datorită luminozității de 300 de nituri, chiar și &icirc;n condiții de iluminare nefavorabile. C&acirc;nd vine vorba de tehnologia tactilă, alegeți &icirc;ntre două opțiuni: o suprafață rezistivă sau capacitivă din sticlă. Ambele variante oferă o operare convenabilă și precisă.</p>\r\n<p>&Icirc;n centrul P1000, un procesor Intel Celeron J1900 Quad-Core cu 2 GHz se confruntă cu toate provocările care așteaptă POS-ul modern și cu trafic ridicat. 2 GB RAM (extensibil p&acirc;nă la 8 GB) și un hard disk SSD de 64 GB oferă mai mult dec&acirc;t suficientă putere de calcul și spațiu de stocare, astfel &icirc;nc&acirc;t chiar și aplicațiile complexe să ruleze fără probleme. Opțional, este disponibil un hard disk HDD. &Icirc;n ciuda performanțelor sale, sistemul POS nu necesită ventilație mecanică, ceea ce &icirc;nseamnă uzură redusă și fără zgomot.</p>\r\n<p>Pentru a conecta sistemul POS și selecția individuală a perifericelor, P1000 are numeroase interfețe, inclusiv 2 sloturi serial / COM, 4 USB 2.0 și 1 USB 3.0. Există, de asemenea, un port LAN Gigabit pentru transmiterea rapidă a datelor Ethernet și o conexiune VGA pentru ecrane suplimentare. Desigur, este disponibilă și o conexiune de 24V pentru sertarul de numerar la alegere. &Icirc;n plus, P1000 este echipat cu un suport VESA 100, ceea ce &icirc;l face potrivit și pentru montarea pe perete - ideal pentru birouri de v&acirc;nzare minimaliste sau un POS cu spațiu limitat.</p>\r\n<p>&Icirc;n ceea ce privește accesoriile, aveți diverse posibilități de extindere individuală a domeniului de aplicare al P1000. Un afișaj pentru clienți cu 2 x 20 de caractere sau chiar un monitor complet pentru clienți, de exemplu, prezintă felicitări, informații despre v&acirc;nzare, notificări de reduceri și multe altele la POS.</p>','','POS all-in-one P1000 Colormetrics','POS all-in-one pentru bugete mici si cerinte mari','POS_ all_ one_ P1000 Colormetrics'),(77,'ro','Honeywell PC43K','<p>8750Honeywell PC43K, 12 dots/mm (300dpi), USB, Wi-Fi</p>','Honeywell PC43K, 12 dots/mm (300dpi), USB, Wi-Fi','<p>Sistemul de chioșc all-in-one Honeywell PC43K constă dintr-o tabletă integrată, imprimantă, scaner și software de configurare și a fost special dezvoltat pentru aplicații specifice clienților din mediile de v&acirc;nzare cu amănuntul. Vine direct din fabrică cu un motor de scanare preinstalat, un braț articulat pentru tabletă, o imprimantă directă de etichete termice și un suport de perete / masă.</p>\r\n<p>Securitatea are prioritate maximă pentru PC43K. Prin urmare, sistemul chioșcului oferă &icirc;n mod regulat patch-uri de securitate pentru Android.</p>\r\n<p>Tableta integrată (Honeywell ScanPal EDA71) convinge cu un ecran tactil HD de 7 \", un procesor Qualcomm cu 8 nuclee de 1,8 GHz, 2/4 GB RAM și memorie flash de 32/64 GB. Wi-Fi 802.11ac, Bluetooth 4.2, NFC, VoIP și VPN permit comunicarea fără fir.</p>\r\n<p>Imprimanta termică directă integrată este echipată din fabrică cu toate aplicațiile de configurare necesare și este ușor de operat și de &icirc;ntreținut utiliz&acirc;nd o gamă largă de limbaje de comandă de imprimare. Creează coduri de bare 1D și 2D la o viteză maximă de imprimare de 152,4 mm / sec. la o rezoluție de 300 dpi. De asemenea, acceptă formate grafice BMP, GIF, PCX și PNG pe un bit.</p>','<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CARACTERISTICI</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Software compatibil:</strong></em> Wavelink Avalanche, PrintSet Honeywell, SmartSystems Foundation<br /><em><strong>Drivere compatibile:</strong></em> Honeywell Label Design and Print Package, CUPS pentru Linux, InterDriver Windows, Honeywell Device Types for SAP<br /><em><strong>Domeniu de aplicare:</strong></em> Comerț cu amănuntul, companii aeriene, ospitalitate (restaurante, hoteluri ...)</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SPECIFICAȚII DE IMPRIMARE</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Seturi de caractere:</strong> </em>Baltic, Baltic RIM, Arab, Thai, Monotype Universal Font Scaling Technology (UFST), engleză, greacă, WorldType Layout Engine (WTLE), vietnamez, chirilic, turc, ebraic, extins, latin<br />Tip de font descărcabil: OpenType, TrueType, Metodă de imprimare, Termică directă, Coduri de bare liniare,<br />GS1 DataBar, HIBC 39, Cod 2 din 5, Codabar, EAN-8, Cod 128, UPC-A / EAN-13 cu cod de cupon extins, Cod 39, RSS-14, Matrice 2 din 5, Cod IATA 2 din 5, UCC 128, UPC-A, intercalat 2 din 5, cod 11,<br />Cod 93 și 93i, Plessey, MSI, Emulare EAN-UCC, UPC-E, Grid Matrix, HIBC 128, EAN-13, Cupon GS1 Cod 32 (PARAF), MSI (modificat Plessey), POSTNET<br /><em><strong>Coduri de bare 2D:</strong></em> PDF417, cod Chinese Sensible (Han Xin), MaxiCode, Matrice de date, Codablock F,<br />MicroPDF417, Dot Code, Codablock A, QR-Code, Code 49, Aztec, Code 16K<br /><em><strong>Font rezident:</strong></em> Letter Gothic, Univers, OCR-B, OCR-A, Andale Mono Bold, Universe Bold, CG Times,<br />Univers Condensed Bold, Univers Extra Condensed, Andale Mono, Century Schoolbook, CG Times, Bold</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>MEDIA</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Tip suport media imprimantă:</strong></em> etichetă<br /><em><strong>Diametrul maxim al ruloului media:</strong></em> 127 mm / 5 \"</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>REŢEA</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Protocol de comunicații:</strong> </em>WEP static (64/128 biți), EAP-TLS, WPA, WPA2, EAP-FAST, LEAP, EAP-PEAP, certificat Wi-Fi, WEP dinamic, EAP-TTLS<br /><em><strong>Specificații de rețea:</strong></em> Bluetooth v4.2, 802.11 a / b / g / n / ac<br /><em><strong>Comunicare wireless:</strong></em> VPN, WiFi, NFC, VoIP, Bluetooth, GPS</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SOFTWARE ȘI FIRMWARE</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Limbaj de comandă pentru imprimantă:</strong></em> ESim (EPL), DP, activat XML pentru SAP&reg; AII și Oracle&reg; WMS, DSim (DPL), IPL, ZSim2 (ZPL-II)<br />MEMORIE ȘI DATE<br /><em><strong>Format fișier imagine:</strong></em> GIF, PCX, PNG, BMP</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>ALIMENTARE</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Frecventa de operare:</strong></em> 50 - 60 Hz<br /><em><strong>Tensiune de operare:</strong> </em>100 - 240V AC</li>\r\n</ul>','Honeywell PC43K','Honeywell PC43K, 12 dots/mm (300dpi), USB, Wi-Fi','Honeywell PC43K'),(76,'ro','Honeywell EDA51','<p>Honeywell EDA51, 2D, SR, BT, Wi-Fi, kit (USB), GMS, black, Android</p>','Honeywell EDA51, 2D, SR, BT, Wi-Fi, kit (USB), GMS, black, Android','<p>Terminalul mobil Honeywell full touch EDA51 este echipat cu un afișaj multi-touch de 5 \"și o baterie puternică schimbabilă și, prin urmare, este ideal pentru &icirc;ntreprinderile mici din comerțul cu amănuntul, transportul, logistica și serviciile de teren. Honeywell a echipat terminalul mobil full touch cu sistemul de operare Android și sprijină clienții dvs. cu actualizări și suport p&acirc;nă la versiunile P și Q. Ce &icirc;nseamnă acest lucru pentru clienții dvs.? Efort de integrare mai mic, costuri reduse și mai multă flexibilitate. &Icirc;n plus, ScanPal EDA51 este compatibil cu accesoriile, bateriile și stațiile de &icirc;ncărcare ale EDA50.</p>\r\n<p>Datorită unui scaner integrat de coduri de bare cu tehnologie rapidă N6603 slim imager, capturarea codurilor de bare 1D și 2D comune este foarte ușoară cu EDA51. Un procesor SDM450 octa-core de 1,8 GHz, 2 GB de memorie RAM și 16 GB de memorie flash asigură performanțe remarcabile. Conectivitatea EDA51 va impresiona, de asemenea: Wi-Fi (802.11a / b / g / n / ac), LTE, GSM &amp; EDGE 2/3/5/8, Bluetooth 4.2, NFC, USB și WWAN opțional. Terminalul mobil full touch este certificat IP64 și rezistent la impact de la 1,2 m.</p>','<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>CARACTERISTICI</strong></span><br /><em>Carcasă:</em> standard<br /><em>Caracteristici:</em> Robusta<br /><em>Camera:</em> Da<br /><em>Domeniu:</em> Retail, Serviciu de teren</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>DIMENSIUNI</strong></span><br /><em>Dimensiuni generale:</em> 15,7 x 7,82 x 1,69 cm / 6,18 x 3,08 x 0,67 in</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SOFTWARE ȘI FIRMWARE</strong></span><br /><em>Sistem de operare:</em> Android 8</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>MEMORIE ȘI DATE</strong></span><br /><em>Memorie:</em> 16 GB Flash / 2 GB RAM</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>HARDWARE</strong></span><br /><em>Procesor:</em> Qualcomm Snapdragon SDM450, 1,8 GHz octa-core<br /><em>Dimensiunea afișajului:</em> 12,7 cm<br /><em>Rezoluția afișajului:</em> 1280 x 720</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>MEDIU</strong></span><br /><em>Gama de temperatură de depozitare:</em> - 20 - 70 &deg; C / - 4 - 158 &deg; F<br /><em>Temperatura de funcționare:</em> - 10 - 50 &deg; C / 14 - 122 &deg; F<br /><em>Umiditate de operare:</em> 10 - 90%</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>STANDARDE ȘI TESTARI</strong></span><br />Specificații \"Tumble\": de 300 de ori la 0,5 m (1,64 ft)<br />Testare la socuri: Socuri multiple de la 1,2 m (4 ft) pe beton la temperatura camerei</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>GARANTIE</strong></span><br /><em>Durata garanției:</em> 1 an</li>\r\n</ul>','Honeywell EDA51','Honeywell EDA51, 2D, SR, BT, Wi-Fi, kit (USB), GMS, black, Android','Honeywell EDA51'),(67,'en','POS all-in-one P1000 Colormetrics','<p>POS all-in-one for low budget and high request</p>','POS all-in-one for low budget and high request','<p>As a fully-fledged all-in-one system for POS areas with a small budget, The P1000 from Colormetrics effortlessly meets high quality and performance standards. It combines a staggeringly low price with a design that impresses both employees and customers in retail and hospitality alike.</p>\r\n<p>All entries and displays of the P1000 are made on the touchscreen. The 1,024 x 768 pixel resolution and 15\'\' screen size ensure that all the displayed contents are easily recognizable - thanks to 300 nits of brightness, even in unfavorable lighting conditions. When it comes to touch technology, you choose between two options: a resistive or glass capacitive surface. Both variants provide conveniently, pinpoint operation.</p>\r\n<p>At the heart of the P1000, an Intel Celeron J1900 Quad-Core with 2 GHz faces all the challenges that await the modern and high-traffic POS. 2 GB of RAM (expandable up to 8 GB) and a 64 GB SSD hard disk offer more than enough computing power and storage space so that even complex applications run smoothly. Optionally, an HDD hard drive is available. Despite its performance, the POS system does not require mechanical ventilation, which means reduced wear and no noise.</p>\r\n<p>To connect the POS system and the individual selection of peripherals, the P1000 features numerous interfaces, including 2 serial/COM, 4 USB 2.0, and 1 USB 3.0 slots. There is also a Gigabit LAN port for fast Ethernet data transmission and a VGA connection for additional screens. A 24V connection for the cash drawer of your choice is of course also available. In addition, the P1000 is equipped with a VESA 100 mount, making it suitable for wall mounting as well - ideal for minimalist sales desks or a POS with limited space.</p>\r\n<p>As far as the accessories are concerned, you have various possibilities to individually extend the scope of application of the P1000. A customer display with 2 x 20 characters or even a fully-fledged customer monitor, for example, present greetings, information about the sale, discount notices, and more at the POS.</p>','','POS all-in-one P1000 Colormetrics','POS all-in-one for low budget and high request','POS_ all_ one_ P1000 Colormetrics'),(68,'ro','Epson TM-T20III','<p>Imprimantă rapidă de chitanțe cu funcție de economisire a h&acirc;rtiei</p>','Imprimantă rapidă de chitanțe cu funcție de economisire a hârtiei','<p>Epson TM-T20III este o imprimantă POS compactă și versiunea actualizată a imprimantei de succes TM-T20II. Cu o viteză mare de imprimare de 250 mm / sec., este semnificativ mai rapidă dec&acirc;t predecesorul său. Chiar și &icirc;n cazul tirajelor mari, acesta &icirc;și păstrează viteza, astfel &icirc;nc&acirc;t utilizatorii să poată reveni rapid la alte provocări - făc&acirc;nd-o ideala pentru spațiile de lucru POS, din magazinele mici, de v&acirc;nzare cu amănuntul și de specialitate, barurile și restaurantele și magazinele alimentare. &Icirc;n plus, TM-T20III impresionează prin fiabilitatea, calitatea și costul total de achizitie extrem de scazut. Datorită funcției sale de reducere automată a h&acirc;rtiei, marginile sunt reduse &icirc;n timpul imprimării și cantitatea de h&acirc;rtie utilizată este monitorizată și controlată - economisind costurile h&acirc;rtiei și făc&acirc;nd imprimarea documentelor și mai flexibilă.</p>\r\n<p>Un alt avantaj al imprimantei POS: este compatibila cu toate accesoriile standard Epson existente -&nbsp; și de asemenea economisești costuri suplimentare. Pentru o conexiune bună, TM-T20III are interfețe USB, Ethernet și seriale.</p>','','Epson TM-T20III','Imprimanta rapida de chitante cu functie de economisire a hârtiei','Epson T20III'),(68,'en','Epson TM-T20III','<p>Fast receipt printer with a paper-saving function</p>','Epson TM-T20III, USB, RS232, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), cutter, ePOS, black','<p>The Epson TM-T20III is a compact POS printer and the updated version of the successful TM-T20II. With its high printing speed of 250 mm/sec., it is significantly faster than its predecessor. Even during high print runs it retains its speed, so that users may quickly return to other challenges &ndash; making them ideal for POS workspaces in small retail and specialty stores, bars &amp; restaurants and grocery stores. Plus, the TM-T20III impresses with its extremely high reliability, quality and low total cost of ownership. Thanks to its automatic paper reduction function, margins are reduced during printing and the amount of paper used is monitored and controlled &ndash; saving on paper costs and making document printing even more flexible.</p>\r\n<p>Another advantage of the POS printer: it is compatible with all existing Epson standard accessories - very convenient and it also saves further costs. For a good connection the TM-T20III has USB, Ethernet and serial interfaces.</p>','','Epson TM-T20III','Epson TM-T20III, USB, RS232, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), cutter, ePOS, black','Epson T20III'),(69,'ro','Star TSP143IIU ECO','<p>Star TSP143IIU ECO, USB, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), cutter, dark grey</p>','Star TSP143IIU ECO, USB, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), cutter, dark grey','<p>Cu tehnologia sa PRNT orientată spre viitor, imprimanta POS cu costuri reduse și de &icirc;naltă calitate Star TSP100 este alegerea perfectă pentru retail și ospitalitate. Cu AllReceipts, clienții cu amănuntul primesc rapid o copie digitală a chitanțelor tipărite. Această caracteristică este activată cu driverul de imprimantă și funcționează cu o aplicație, independent de software-ul POS.</p>\r\n<p>Gestionarea inteligentă a energiei pe modelul TSP143IIECO reduce consumul de energie cu p&acirc;nă la 40%, depășind astfel cerințele Energy Star. Viitoarele instrumente software PRNT susțin &icirc;n continuare acest obiectiv: chitanțele sunt tipărite numai la cerere, marginea superioară este redusă la 3 mm, facturile de 80 mm pot fi reduse la 58 mm și opțional reduse la 50%.</p>\r\n<p>Imprimanta USB Star TSP143IIIU se conectează, de asemenea, direct la un iPad sau iPhone utiliz&acirc;nd cablul Lightning furnizat de Apple pentru o comunicare USB fiabilă, spre deosebire de tehnologiile anterioare numai wireless iOS - elimin&acirc;nd astfel problemele obișnuite ale utilizatorului de configurare Bluetooth sau WiFi / LAN cu fir &icirc;n jurul perechii, infrastructurii de rețea, conectivității etc.</p>\r\n<p>Seria TSP100 este renumită pentru stabilirea de noi standarde at&acirc;t pentru POS-urile tradiționale, c&acirc;t și pentru piața de tablete POS &icirc;n creștere rapidă, datorită combinației sale de caracteristici ușor de utilizat și a gamei de opțiuni de conectivitate, inclusiv USB, Lightning USB, Ethernet LAN, Bluetooth și WLAN. TSP100PUSBE imprimă chiar și facturi complexe cu sigle, grafică și text TrueType &icirc;n c&acirc;teva secunde. Poate rula pe interfața USB alimentată sau pe adaptorul de alimentare integrat standard. TSP100LAN este un model eficient din punct de vedere al costurilor, dar oferă transfer rapid de date și o mare flexibilitate datorită interfeței sale 10/100 Base-T. &Icirc;n afară de viteza mare de imprimare, caracteristica convingătoare a modelului GT este acoperirea sa elegantă cu luciu ridicat.</p>\r\n<p>&Icirc;n afară de pachetul software complet viitor PRNT, veți primi și cabluri de alimentare și de date (nu cu TSP100PUSB), un adaptor pentru role de h&acirc;rtie, un kit de montare pentru instalare verticală și pe perete și multe altele. Compatibilitatea ridicată a imprimantei cu diverse sisteme de operare, cum ar fi Windows, Linux, Java POS, OPOS, Apple MAC și multe altele, asigură implementarea acesteia &icirc;n aproape orice aplicație.</p>','','Star TSP143IIU ECO','Star TSP143IIU ECO, USB, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), cutter, dark grey','Star TSP143IIU ECO_'),(69,'en','Star TSP143IIU ECO','<p>Star TSP143IIU ECO, USB, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), cutter, dark grey</p>','Star TSP143IIU ECO, USB, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), cutter, dark grey','<p>With its future-oriented futurePRNT technology, the low-cost, high-quality POS printer Star TSP100 is the perfect choice for retail and hospitality. With AllReceipts retail customers quickly and anonymously receive a digital copy of printed receipts. This feature is activated with the printer driver and works with an app, independently of the POS software.</p>\r\n<p>The intelligent power management on the TSP143IIECO model reduces energy consumption by up to 40%, thereby exceeding Energy Star requirements. The futurePRNT software tools further support this goal: receipts are only printed on demand, the top border is reduced to 3 mm, 80 mm bills can be downsized to 58 mm and optionally scaled to 50%.</p>\r\n<p>The Star TSP143IIIU USB printer also connects directly to an iPad or iPhone using the Apple-supplied Lightning cable for reliable USB communication, as opposed to previous iOS wireless-only technologies &ndash; thereby eliminating the user&rsquo;s usual Bluetooth or WiFi/wired LAN set-up issues around pairing, network infrastructure, connectivity, etc.</p>\r\n<p>The TSP100 Series is renowned for setting new standards for both traditional POS and the fast growing Tablet POS market, due to its combination of user-friendly features and range of connectivity options, including USB, Lightning USB, Ethernet LAN, Bluetooth and WLAN.The TSP100PUSBE even prints out complex bills with logos, graphics and TrueType text within seconds. It can run on the Powered USB interface or its standard integrated power adapter. The TSP100LAN is a cost-effective model, yet it offers fast data transfer and great flexibility thanks to its 10/100 Base-T interface. Apart from its high print speed, the GT model\'s convincing feature is its stylish high-gloss coating.</p>\r\n<p>Aside from the complete futurePRNT software package, you also get power and data cables (not with TSP100PUSB), a paper roll adapter, a mounting kit for vertical and wall installation, and much more. The printer\'s high compatibility with diverse operating systems, such as Windows, Linux, Java POS, OPOS, Apple MAC, and more, ensure its implementation in almost any application.</p>','','Star TSP143IIU ECO','Star TSP143IIU ECO, USB, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), cutter, dark grey','Star TSP143IIU ECO_'),(70,'ro','Epson TM-P20 - imprimanta termica portabila','<p>Epson TM-P20, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), ePOS, USB, BT, NFC</p>','Epson TM-P20, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), ePOS, USB, BT, NFC','<p>Epson TM-P20 este o imprimantă termică directă compactă de 2 \"pentru imprimarea ușoară de pe un smartphone sau tabletă - optimă pentru utilizare &icirc;n comerțul cu amănuntul, &icirc;n ospitalitate și oriunde este necesară imprimarea la cerere a chitanțelor mobile. Imprimanta acceptă NFC, plus opțional Bluetooth 3.0 sau Wi-Fi (802.11b / g / n (2,4 GHz) / 802.11a/n (5 GHz)). &Icirc;n acest fel, &icirc;l conectați cu ușurință la orice dispozitiv portabil sau inteligent. Acest lucru simplifică foarte mult integrarea &icirc;n sistemele existente.</p>\r\n<p>Cu dimensiunile sale compacte de 79 x 120 x 44 mm și greutatea de doar 228 g, utilizatorii transportă imprimanta confortabil cu ele. Cu capacul de protecție opțional, imprimanta este certificată IP54 și rezistă la picături multiple de la &icirc;nălțimi de 1,5 m. TM-P20 imprimă cu o viteză de p&acirc;nă la 100 mm / secundă. Datorită funcției sale de economisire a h&acirc;rtiei, economisește p&acirc;nă la 23% la consumabile, reduc&acirc;nd costurile de operare. Imprimanta funcționează p&acirc;nă la 8 ore cu o singură &icirc;ncărcare a bateriei (Bluetooth), respectiv 6 ore (Wi-Fi).</p>','','Epson TM-P20 - imprimanta termica portabila','Epson TM-P20, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), ePOS, USB, BT, NFC','Epson P20_ imprimanta termica portabila'),(70,'en','Epson TM-P20, mobile thermal printer','<p>Epson TM-P20, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), ePOS, USB, BT, NFC</p>','Epson TM-P20, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), ePOS, USB, BT, NFC','<p>The Epson TM-P20 is a compact 2\" direct thermal mobile printer for easy printing from a smartphone or tablet &ndash; optimal for usage in retail, hospitality and everywhere where on-demand mobile receipt printing is needed. The printer supports NFC, plus optionally Bluetooth 3.0 or Wi-Fi (802.11b/g/n (2.4 GHz)/802.11a/n (5 GHz)). This way, you connect it easily with every handheld or smart device. This greatly simplifies integration into existing systems.</p>\r\n<p>With its compact size of 79 x 120 x 44 mm and a weight of a mere 228 g, users carry the printer comfortably with them. With the optional protective cover the printer is IP54-certified and withstands multiple drops from heights of 1.5 m. The TM-P20 prints with a speed of up to 100 mm/second. Thanks to its paper saving function it saves up to 23% on consumables, lowering operating costs. The printer operates up to 8 hours on one battery charge (Bluetooth), respectively 6 hours (Wi-Fi).</p>','','Epson TM-P20, mobile termal printer','Epson TM-P20, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), ePOS, USB, BT, NFC','Epson P20_ mobile thermal printer'),(71,'ro','Citizen CMP-20II, imprimanta termica portabila','<p>Citizen CMP-20II, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), CPCL, USB, RS232, BT (iOS)</p>','Citizen CMP-20II, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), CPCL, USB, RS232, BT (iOS)','<p>CMP-20II este cel mai mic din familia imprimantelor mobile Citizen - dar este mare &icirc;n ceea ce privește performanța, caracteristicile inteligente și construcția robustă. Acest lucru &icirc;l face ideal atunci c&acirc;nd doriți să imprimați mobil chitanțe, bilete, note de livrare sau facturi, de exemplu. Dispozitivul produce fișe de v&acirc;nzare de 58 mm (2,3 \") prin imprimare termică directă p&acirc;nă la 80 mm / sec și 8 puncte / mm (203 dpi). Suportă limbile de imprimare ECS / POS, CPCL și ZPL.</p>\r\n<p>Schimbarea bine g&acirc;ndită a rolelor asigură o manipulare convenabilă: pe de o parte, capacitatea pentru role cu diametrul de p&acirc;nă la 48 mm face modificările rare, iar pe de altă parte, pur și simplu introduceți noua - &icirc;ncărcare de h&acirc;rtie și diferiți senzori se ocupă de restul, fără a irosi h&acirc;rtia pentru o ajustare. Trei interfețe integrate standard oferă un spectru larg de aplicații: RS-232, USB și Bluetooth pentru o comunicare ușoară cu dispozitivele Apple. Adăugați la acesta portul WLAN opțional. Nu &icirc;n ultimul r&acirc;nd, imprimanta mobilă rezistă, de asemenea, la impactul dur ocazional, datorită carcasei sale robuste din plastic.</p>','','Citizen CMP-20II, imprimanta termica portabila','Citizen CMP-20II, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), CPCL, USB, RS232, BT (iOS)','Citizen CMP_ 20II imprimanta termica portabila'),(71,'en','Citizen CMP-20II, mobile thermal printer','<p>Citizen CMP-20II, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), CPCL, USB, RS232, BT (iOS)</p>\r\n<p>Art. no.&nbsp;cit202bt</p>','Citizen CMP-20II, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), CPCL, USB, RS232, BT (iOS)','<p>Citizen CMP-20II,&nbsp;8 dots/mm (203 dpi), CPCL, USB, RS232, BT (iOS)&nbsp;(cit202bt - CMP20IIBUXCX)<br />mobile printer, direct thermal, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), media width (max.): 58 mm, print width (max.): 48 mm, speed (max.): 80 mm/s, USB, RS232, Bluetooth (iOS), ESC/POS, CPCL, incl.: power supply unit (EU, US), belt clip, battery, 2000mAh, receipt roll</p>\r\n<p>The CMP-20II is the smallest in the Citizen mobile printer family - but it is big in performance, intelligent features, and robust construction. That makes it ideal when you wish to mobile print receipts, tickets, delivery notes, or invoices, for example. The device produces 58 mm (2.3\'\') sales slips via direct thermal printing at up to 80 mm/sec and 8 dots/mm (203 dpi). It supports the printer languages ECS/POS, CPCL, and ZPL.</p>\r\n<p>The well-thought-out roll change ensures convenient handling: on the one hand, the capacity for rolls up to 48 mm in diameter make changes rare, and on the other hand, you simply drop in the new one - drop-in paper loading and diverse sensors take care of the rest, without wasting paper for an adjustment. Three standard integrated interfaces provide a broad spectrum of applications: RS-232, USB, and Bluetooth for smooth communication with Apple devices. Add to this the optional WLAN port. Last but not least, the mobile printer also withstands the occasional hard impact, thanks to its robust plastic housing.</p>','<p>Citizen CMP-20II,&nbsp;8 dots/mm (203 dpi), CPCL, USB, RS232, BT (iOS)&nbsp;(cit202bt - CMP20IIBUXCX)<br />mobile printer, direct thermal, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), media width (max.): 58 mm, print width (max.): 48 mm, speed (max.): 80 mm/s, USB, RS232, Bluetooth (iOS), ESC/POS, CPCL, incl.: power supply unit (EU, US), belt clip, battery, 2000mAh, receipt roll</p>','Citizen CMP-20II, mobile thermal printer','Citizen CMP-20II, 8 dots/mm (203 dpi), CPCL, USB, RS232, BT (iOS)','Citizen CMP_ 20II mobile thermal printer'),(72,'ro','RO','','','','','RO','',''),(72,'en','RO','','','','','RO','',''),(72,'fr','','','','','','','',''),(73,'ro','FR','','','','','FR','',''),(73,'en','FR','','','','','FR','',''),(73,'fr','','','','','','','',''),(74,'ro','UK','','','','','UK','',''),(74,'en','UK','','','','','UK','',''),(74,'fr','','','','','','','',''),(77,'en','Honeywell PC43K','<p>Honeywell PC43K, 12 dots/mm (300dpi), USB, Wi-Fi</p>','Honeywell PC43K, 12 dots/mm (300dpi), USB, Wi-Fi','<p>The Honeywell PC43K all-in-one kiosk system consists of an integrated tablet, printer, scanner and configuration software and was specially developed for customer-specific applications in retail environments. It comes factory-direct with a pre-installed scan engine, an articulated arm for the tablet, a direct thermal label printer and a wall/table mount.</p>\r\n<p>Security has top priority for the PC43K. Therefore, the kiosk system regularly offers security patches for Android.</p>\r\n<p>The integrated tablet (Honeywell ScanPal EDA71) convinces with a 7\" HD touch display, a 1.8 GHz Qualcomm 8-core processor, 2/4 GB RAM and 32/64 GB flash memory. Wi-Fi 802.11ac, Bluetooth 4.2, NFC, VoIP and VPN allow for wireless communication.</p>\r\n<p>The integrated direct thermal printer is factory-fitted with all necessary configuration applications and is easy to operate and maintain using a broad range of print command languages. It creates 1D and 2D barcodes at a maximum print speed of 152.4 mm/sec. at a resolution of 300 dpi. It also supports one-bit BMP, GIF, PCX and PNG graphics formats.</p>','<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></span><br /><strong><em>Compatible Software:</em></strong> Wavelink Avalanche , PrintSet&nbsp; Honeywell, SmartSystems Foundation<br /><strong><em>Compatible Drivers:</em></strong>&nbsp;Honeywell Label Design and Print Package, CUPS for Linux, InterDriver Windows, Honeywell Device Types for SAP<br /><strong><em>Application:</em></strong> Retail, Airline, Hospitality</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>PRINTING SPECIFICATIONS</strong></span><br /><strong><em>Character Sets:&nbsp;</em></strong>Baltic, Baltic RIM, Arabic, Thai, Monotype Universal Font Scaling Technology (UFST), English, Greek, WorldType Layout Engine (WTLE), Vietnamese, Cyrillic, Turkish, Hebrew, Extended, Latin<br /><em><strong>Downloadable Font Type:</strong>&nbsp;</em>OpenType, TrueType, Print Method, Direct Thermal, Linear Barcodes,<br />GS1 DataBar, HIBC 39, Code 2 of 5, Codabar, EAN-8,Code 128, UPC-A/ EAN-13 with Extended Coupon Code, Code 39, RSS-14, Matrix 2 of 5, IATA Code 2 of 5, UCC 128, UPC-A, Interleaved 2 of 5, Code 11,<br />Code 93 and 93i, Plessey, MSI, EAN-UCC Emulation, UPC-E, Grid Matrix, HIBC 128 , EAN-13, Coupon GS1 Code 32 (PARAF), MSI (modified Plessey), POSTNET<br /><em>2D Barcodes:&nbsp;</em>PDF417, Chinese Sensible (Han Xin) Code, MaxiCode, Data Matrix, Codablock F,&nbsp;<br />MicroPDF417, Dot Code, Codablock A, QR-Code, Code 49, Aztec, Code 16K<br /><strong><em>Resident Font:&nbsp;</em></strong>Letter Gothic, Univers, OCR-B, OCR-A, Andale Mono Bold, Univers Bold, CG Times,<br />Univers Condensed Bold, Univers Extra Condensed, Andale Mono, Century Schoolbook, CG Times, Bold</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>MEDIA</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Printer Media Type :&nbsp;</strong></em>Label<br /><em><strong>Maximum Media Roll Diameter:&nbsp;</strong></em>127mm / 5\"</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>NETWORK</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Communications Protocol:&nbsp;</strong></em>WEP static (64/128 bits), EAP-TLS, WPA, WPA2, EAP-FAST,LEAP, EAP-PEAP, Wi-Fi certified, WEP dynamic, EAP-TTLS<br /><em><strong>Network Specifications:&nbsp;</strong></em>Bluetooth v4.2, 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac<br /><em><strong>Wireless Communication:&nbsp;</strong></em>VPN, WiFi, NFC, VoIP, Bluetooth, GPS</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SOFTWARE &amp; FIRMWARE</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Printer Command Language:&nbsp;</strong></em>ESim (EPL), DP, XML-enabled for SAP&reg; AII and Oracle&reg; WMS, DSim (DPL), IPL, ZSim2 (ZPL-II)</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>MEMORY &amp; DATA</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Image File Format:&nbsp;</strong></em>GIF, PCX, PNG, BMP</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>ELECTRICAL</strong></span><br /><em><strong>Operating Frequency:&nbsp;</strong></em>50 - 60 Hz<br /><em><strong>Operating Voltage:&nbsp;</strong></em>100 - 240V AC</li>\r\n</ul>','Honeywell PC43K','Honeywell PC43K, 12 dots/mm (300dpi), USB, Wi-Fi','Honeywell PC43K'),(78,'en','Terms and Conditions','','Privacy Policy, Terms &amp; Conditions\r\nPRIVACY POLICY, TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS\r\nOur Website is directed towards users who reside in the UK and EU. By using the Services, you affirm that you reside in the UK or EU, and you consent to the collection, storag','<p>Privacy Policy, Terms &amp; Conditions</p>\r\n<p>PRIVACY POLICY, TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</p>\r\n<p>Our Website is directed towards users who reside in the UK and EU. By using the Services, you affirm that you reside in the UK or EU, and you consent to the collection, storage, processing, and transfer of your information in and to the EU, pursuant to the laws of the EU. We do not knowingly collect, use, or disclose information of European Union residents or UK.</p>\r\n<p>----</p>\r\n<p>SECTION 1 - INFORMATION WE COLLECT</p>\r\n<p>We collect information that identifies, relates to, describes, references, is capable of being associated with, or could reasonably be linked, directly or indirectly, with a particular consumer or device (&ldquo;personal information&rdquo;). In particular, we have collected the following categories of personal information from consumers within the last twelve (12) months:</p>\r\n<p>Category<br />Examples<br />Collected<br />A. Identifiers.<br />A real name, alias, postal address, unique personal identifier, online identifier, Internet Protocol address, email address, account name, Social Security number, driver\'s license number, passport number, or other similar identifiers.<br />YES<br />B. Personal information categories listed in the California Customer Records statute (Cal. Civ. Code &sect; 1798.80(e)).<br />A name, signature, Social Security number, physical characteristics or description, address, telephone number, passport number, driver\'s license or state identification card number, insurance policy number, education, employment, employment history, bank account number, credit card number, debit card number, or any other financial information, medical information, or health insurance information. Some personal information included in this category may overlap with other categories.<br />YES<br />C. Protected classification characteristics under California or federal law.<br />Age (40 years or older), race, color, ancestry, national origin, citizenship, religion or creed, marital status, medical condition, physical or mental disability, sex (including gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy or childbirth and related medical conditions), sexual orientation, veteran or military status, genetic information (including familial genetic information).<br />NO<br />D. Commercial information.<br />Records of personal property, products or services purchased, obtained, or considered, or other purchasing or consuming histories or tendencies.<br />NO<br />E. Biometric information.<br />Genetic, physiological, behavioral, and biological characteristics, or activity patterns used to extract a template or other identifier or identifying information, such as, fingerprints, faceprints, and voiceprints, iris or retina scans, keystroke, gait, or other physical patterns, and sleep, health, or exercise data.<br />NO<br />F. Internet or other similar network activity.<br />Browsing history, search history, information on a consumer\'s interaction with a website, application, or advertisement.<br />NO<br />G. Geolocation data.<br />Physical location or movements.<br />NO<br />H. Sensory data.<br />Audio, electronic, visual, thermal, olfactory, or similar information.<br />NO<br />I. Professional or employment-related information.<br />Current or past job history or performance evaluations.<br />NO<br />J. Non-public education information<br />Education records directly related to a student maintained by an educational institution or party acting on its behalf, such as grades, transcripts, class lists, student schedules, student identification codes, student financial information, or student disciplinary records.<br />NO<br />K. Inferences drawn from other personal information.<br />Profile reflecting a person\'s preferences, characteristics, psychological trends, predispositions, behavior, attitudes, intelligence, abilities, and aptitudes.<br />NO<br />When you purchase something from our store, as part of the buying and selling process, we collect the personal information you give us such as your name, address, phone number and email address.</p>\r\n<p>When you browse our store, we also automatically receive your computer&rsquo;s internet protocol (IP) address in order to provide us with information that helps us learn about your browser and operating system.</p>\r\n<p>Email marketing (if applicable): With your permission, we may send you emails about our store, new products, services and solutions and other updates.</p>\r\n<p>Personal information does not include:</p>\r\n<p>Publicly available information from government records.<br /> <br />De-identified or aggregated consumer information.<br /> <br />Information excluded from the CCPA\'s scope, like:<br />health or medical information covered by the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability;<br /> <br />personal information covered by certain sector-specific privacy laws, <br /> <br />We do not share, sell, rent, or trade User Personal Information with third parties for their commercial purposes.&nbsp;In the preceding twelve (12) months, we have not sold any personal information.</p>\r\n<p>Use of Personal Information</p>\r\n<p>We may use or disclose the personal information we collect for one or more of the following business purposes:</p>\r\n<p>To fulfill or meet the reason for which the information is provided. For example, if you provide us with personal information in order for us to purchase a product, we will use that information to fulfill the order.<br /> <br />To provide you with information, products or services that you request from us.<br /> <br />To provide you with email alerts, event registrations and other notices concerning our products or services, or events or news, that may be of interest to you.<br /> <br />To carry out our obligations and enforce our rights arising from any contracts entered into between you and us, including for billing and collections.<br /> <br />To improve our website and present its contents to you.<br /> <br />For testing, research, analysis and product development.<br /> <br />As necessary or appropriate to protect the rights, property or safety of us, our clients or others.<br /> <br />To respond to law enforcement requests and as required by applicable law, court order, or governmental regulations.<br /> <br />As described to you when collecting your personal information or as otherwise set forth in the CCPA.<br /> <br />We will not collect additional categories of personal information or use the personal information we collected for materially different, unrelated, or incompatible purposes without providing you notice.</p>\r\n<p>SECTION 2 - CONSENT</p>\r\n<p>We obtain the categories of personal information listed above from the following categories of sources:</p>\r\n<p>Directly from our clients or their agents. For example, from documents that our clients provide to us related to the services for which they engage us.<br /> <br />Indirectly from our clients or their agents. For example, through information we collect from our clients in the course of providing services to them.<br /> <br />Directly and indirectly from activity on our website (www.dotit.com). For example, from submissions through our website portal or website usage details collected automatically.<br /> <br />How do you get my consent?</p>\r\n<p>When you provide us with personal information to complete a transaction, verify your credit card, place an order, arrange for a delivery or return a purchase, we imply that you consent to our collecting it and using it for that specific reason only.</p>\r\n<p>If we ask for your personal information for a secondary reason, like marketing, we will either ask you directly for your expressed consent, or provide you with an opportunity to say no.</p>\r\n<p><br /> How do I withdraw my consent?</p>\r\n<p>If after you opt-in, you change your mind, you may withdraw your consent for us to contact you, for the continued collection, use or disclosure of your information, at anytime, by contacting us at office@xhaccp.co.uk&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Your Rights and Choices</p>\r\n<p>The EU provides consumers (EU residents) with specific rights regarding their personal information. This section describes your EU rights and explains how to exercise those rights.</p>\r\n<p>Access to Specific Information and Data Portability Rights</p>\r\n<p>You have the right to request that we disclose certain information to you about our collection and use of your personal information over the past 12 months. Once we receive and confirm your verifiable consumer request, we will disclose to you:</p>\r\n<p>The categories of personal information we collected about you.<br /> <br />The categories of sources for the personal information we collected about you.<br /> <br />Our business or commercial purpose for collecting or selling that personal information.<br /> <br />The categories of third parties with whom we share that personal information.<br /> <br />The specific pieces of personal information we collected about you (also called a data portability request).<br /> <br />If we sold or disclosed your personal information for a business purpose, two separate lists disclosing:<br />sales, identifying the personal information categories that each category of recipient purchased; and<br /> <br />disclosures for a business purpose, identifying the personal information categories that each category of recipient obtained.<br /> <br />Deletion Request Rights</p>\r\n<p>You have the right to request that we delete any of your personal information that we collected from you and retained, subject to certain exceptions. Once we receive and confirm your verifiable consumer request, we will delete (and direct our service providers to delete) your personal information from our records, unless an exception applies.</p>\r\n<p>We may deny your deletion request if retaining the information is necessary for us or our service providers to:</p>\r\n<p>Complete the transaction for which we collected the personal information, provide a good or service that you requested, take actions reasonably anticipated within the context of our ongoing business relationship with you, or otherwise perform our contract with you.<br /> <br />Detect security incidents, protect against malicious, deceptive, fraudulent, or illegal activity, or prosecute those responsible for such activities.<br /> <br />Debug products to identify and repair errors that impair existing intended functionality.<br /> <br />Exercise free speech, ensure the right of another consumer to exercise their free speech rights or exercise another right provided for by law.<br /> <br />Comply with the EU law<br />Engage in public or peer-reviewed scientific, historical, or statistical research in the public interest that adheres to all other applicable ethics and privacy laws, when the information\'s deletion may likely render impossible or seriously impair the research\'s achievement if you previously provided informed consent.<br /> <br />Enable solely internal uses that are reasonably aligned with consumer expectations based on your relationship with us.<br /> <br />Comply with a legal obligation.<br /> <br />Make other internal and lawful uses of that information that are compatible with the context in which you provided it.<br /> <br />Exercising Access, Data Portability, and Deletion Rights</p>\r\n<p>To exercise the access, data portability, and deletion rights described above, please submit a verifiable consumer request to us by either:</p>\r\n<p>Emailing office@xhaccp.co.uk<br />You may only make a verifiable consumer request for access or data portability twice within a 12-month period. The verifiable consumer request must:</p>\r\n<p>Provide sufficient information that allows us to reasonably verify you are the person about whom we collected personal information or an authorized representative.<br /> <br />Describe your request with sufficient detail that allows us to properly understand, evaluate, and respond to it.<br /> <br />We cannot respond to your request or provide you with personal information if we cannot verify your identity or authority to make the request and confirm the personal information relates to you.&nbsp; Making a verifiable consumer request does not require you to create an account with us.&nbsp; We will only use personal information provided in a verifiable consumer request to verify the requestor\'s identity or authority to make the request.</p>\r\n<p>Response Timing and Format</p>\r\n<p>We endeavor to respond to a verifiable consumer request within 45 days of its receipt.&nbsp; If we require more time (up to 90 days), we will inform you of the reason and extension period in writing.&nbsp; If you have an account with us, we will deliver our written response to that account.&nbsp; If you do not have an account with us, we will deliver our written response by mail or electronically, at your option.&nbsp; Any disclosures we provide will only cover the 12-month period preceding the verifiable consumer request\'s receipt.&nbsp; The response we provide will also explain the reasons we cannot comply with a request, if applicable.&nbsp; For data portability requests, we will select a format to provide your personal information that is readily useable and should allow you to transmit the information from one entity to another entity without hindrance.</p>\r\n<p>We do not charge a fee to process or respond to your verifiable consumer request unless it is excessive, repetitive, or manifestly unfounded.&nbsp; If we determine that the request warrants a fee, we will tell you why we made that decision and provide you with a cost estimate before completing your request.</p>\r\n<p>Non-Discrimination</p>\r\n<p>We will not discriminate against you for exercising any of your EU rights. Unless permitted by the EU law, we will not:</p>\r\n<p>Deny you goods or services.<br /> <br />Charge you different prices or rates for goods or services, including through granting discounts or other benefits, or imposing penalties.<br /> <br />Provide you a different level or quality of goods or services<br /> <br />Suggest that you may receive a different price or rate for goods or services or a different level or quality of goods or services.</p>\r\n<p>SECTION 3 - DISCLOSURE</p>\r\n<p>We may disclose your personal information if we are required by law to do so or if you violate our Terms of Service.</p>\r\n<p><br /> SECTION 4 - One</p>\r\n<p>Our store is hosted on one.com. They provide us with a hosting platform that allows us to sell our products and services to you.</p>\r\n<p>Your data is stored through one.com data storage, databases, and the general one.com application. They store your data on a secure server behind a firewall.</p>\r\n<p><br /> Payment:</p>\r\n<p>If you choose a direct payment gateway to complete your purchase, then Magento stores your credit card data. It is encrypted through the Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard (PCI-DSS). Your purchase transaction data is stored only as long as is necessary to complete your purchase transaction. After that is complete, your purchase transaction information is deleted.</p>\r\n<p>All direct payment gateways adhere to the standards set by PCI-DSS as managed by the PCI Security Standards Council, which is a joint effort of brands like Visa, MasterCard, American Express and Discover.</p>\r\n<p>PCI-DSS requirements help ensure the secure handling of credit card information by our store and its service providers.</p>\r\n<p>For more insight, you may also want to read&nbsp;Magento\'s Terms of Service here or Privacy Statement here.</p>\r\n<p>Shipping:</p>\r\n<p>Online orders over 150.00 GBP are eligible for free shipping at checkout. Only applicable for orders placed online. Applies to orders shipping to the contiguous United States. Shipping rules are subject to change at any time.</p>\r\n<p>Returns:</p>\r\n<p>We are unable to accept returns at this time due to the health and safety concerns of COVID-19.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;Any shipments refused by customers will not be issued credit since they have left our building and we cannot risk unsafe product re-entering our facility.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br />SECTION 5 - THIRD-PARTY SERVICES</p>\r\n<p>In general, the third-party providers used by us will only collect, use and disclose your information to the extent necessary to allow them to perform the services they provide to us.</p>\r\n<p>However, certain third-party service providers, such as payment gateways and other payment transaction processors, have their own privacy policies in respect to the information we are required to provide to them for your purchase-related transactions.</p>\r\n<p>For these providers, we recommend that you read their privacy policies so you can understand the manner in which your personal information will be handled by these providers.</p>\r\n<p>In particular, remember that certain providers may be located in or have facilities that are located in a different jurisdiction than either you or us. So if you elect to proceed with a transaction that involves the services of a third-party service provider, then your information may become subject to the laws of the jurisdiction(s) in which that service provider or its facilities are located.</p>\r\n<p>Once you leave our store&rsquo;s website or are redirected to a third-party website or application, you are no longer governed by this Privacy Policy or our website&rsquo;s Terms of Service. Links</p>\r\n<p>When you click on links on our store, they may direct you away from our site. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of other sites and encourage you to read their privacy statements.</p>\r\n<p><br /> SECTION 6 - SECURITY</p>\r\n<p>To protect your personal information, we take reasonable precautions and follow industry best practices to make sure it is not inappropriately lost, misused, accessed, disclosed, altered or destroyed.</p>\r\n<p>If you provide us with your credit card information, the information is encrypted using secure socket layer technology (SSL) and stored with a AES-256 encryption. Although no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure, we follow all PCI-DSS requirements and implement additional generally accepted industry standards.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>SECTION 7 - AGE OF CONSENT</p>\r\n<p>By using this site, you represent that you are at least the age of majority in your state or province of residence, or that you are the age of majority in your state or province of residence and you have given us your consent to allow any of your minor dependents to use this site.</p>\r\n<p>SECTION 8 - PAYMENT &amp; RETURN POLICY</p>\r\n<p>New Customers</p>\r\n<p>We are unable to extend credit terms to new customers at this time.<br />Orders placed on Net terms over $500 will require a 50% credit card or cash deposit.<br />We will not charge anything additional for credit card processing.<br />Policy for Current Dot It Accounts on Payment Terms</p>\r\n<p>Credit Term changes are effective 4-15-2020</p>\r\n<p>We will honor the terms agreement while in good standing.<br />Accounts with terms that pay late two times over a 6 month period will be transitioned to credit card-only payment terms.<br />Accounts with invoices 31 days or older are placed on hold and no additional orders are processed until payment is made and all invoices are current in line with terms.<br />Attempts to collect payment for overdue invoices will be made.<br />Responsibility to ensure we have accurate contact information is the customer&rsquo;s responsibility.<br />Returns Policy</p>\r\n<p>Returns Policy changes effective 4-15-2020<br />All sales are final<br />We are unable to accept returns at this time due to the health and safety concerns of COVID-19<br />Any shipments refused by customers will not be issued credit as we cannot risk unsafe product re-entering our facility<br />For questions about your account, please contact Accounts Receivable at ar@dotit.com or&nbsp;866-461-0601.</p>\r\n<p>SECTION 9 - CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY</p>\r\n<p>We reserve the right to modify this privacy policy at any time, so please review it frequently. Changes and clarifications will take effect immediately upon their posting on the website. If we make material changes to this policy, we will notify you here that it has been updated, so that you are aware of what information we collect, how we use it, and under what circumstances, if any, we use and/or disclose it.</p>\r\n<p>If our store is acquired or merged with another company, your information may be transferred to the new owners so that we may continue to sell products to you.</p>\r\n<p><br /> QUESTIONS AND CONTACT INFORMATION</p>\r\n<p>If you would like to: access, correct, amend or delete any personal information we have about you, register a complaint, or simply want more information contact our Privacy Compliance Officer</p>\r\n<p>email:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>office@xhaccp.co.uk</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','','Terms and Conditions','Privacy Policy, Terms and Conditions\r\nPRIVACY POLICY, TERMS and CONDITIONS\r\nOur Website is directed towards users who reside in the UK and EU. By using the Services, you affirm that you reside in the UK or EU, and you consent to the collection, storag','Terms and_ Conditions'),(82,'en','','','','','','','',''),(83,'ro','TSC DA210 - imprimanta termica-Conexiune Bluetooth','<p>Imprimanta pentru chitanțe/note de plata și etichete, cu un raport calitate-preț de top</p>','Imprimanta pentru chitanțe/note de plata și etichete, cu un raport calitate-preț de top','<p>Imprimanta termica DA210 de la TSC ne ofera calitate la imprimare atat pe etichete autoadezive cat si pe hartia termica de la notele de plata. Imprimanta funcționează cu hartie termica și etichete autoadezive, imprima p&acirc;nă la 4.5\" lățime. Cu forma compactă și viteza mare de imprimare de 152,4 mm pe secundă, este la fel de potrivita at&acirc;t pentru POS, c&acirc;t și pentru departamentele de expediere, aplicațiile de birou și marketing și pentru generarea de bilete pentru evenimente și transport. &Icirc;n funcție de model, calitatea imprimării este de 203 sau 300 dpi.</p>\r\n<p>Modelele DS210 și DA310 conving cu prețul scăzut și sunt ideale dacă sunteți &icirc;n căutarea unui model entry-level cu caracteristicile de bază ale primirii și imprimării etichetelor. Conectați dispozitivele prin USB 2.0 la gazdă sau, alternativ, utilizați interfața Bluetooth opțională.</p>\r\n<p>Dacă căutați și mai multe opțiuni, variantele DA220 și DA320 oferă și RS-232, Ethernet, USB Host și WLAN 802.11a / b / g / n. Cu 128 MB Flash și 64 MB DRAM, imprimantele din seria DA210 / DA220 au spațiu mai mult dec&acirc;t suficient pentru fonturi, caractere speciale, sigle, grafice și coduri de bare.</p>\r\n<p>Seria DA210&nbsp; convinge prin emularea directă din fabrică a numeroaselor limbaje comune ale imprimantei, inclusiv Line Mode, Eltron, Zebra și Datamax. &Icirc;n acest fel, TSC face foarte ușor pentru utilizatori schimbul de dispozitive vechi fără a fi nevoie să modifice infrastructura existentă.</p>\r\n<p>Imprimantele vin cu o varietate de senzori, inclusiv \"black-mark\", goluri de etichetă și cap deschis. &Icirc;n plus, există un suport pentru role, care face ca adăugarea de noi role și etichete să fie foarte ușoară - &icirc;ntreruperile &icirc;n timpul funcționării sunt reduse la minimum, iar angajații care operează dispozitivul sunt relaxați și mulțumiți.</p>','','TSC DA210 - imprimanta termica','Imprimanta pentru chitante/note de plata si etichete, cu un raport calitate-pret de top','TSC_ DA210 imprimanta termica Conexiune Bluetooth'),(83,'en','TSC DA210/DA220 Series','<p>Receipt and label printers with a top price-performance ratio</p>','Receipt and label printers with a top price-performance ratio','<p>The DA210/DA220 Series from TSC consists of four economical desktop printers for receipts and labels - depending on which resolution and maximum print length you prefer. All the models work with receipt and label rolls up to 4.5\'\' wide. With their compact form and high print speed of 152.4 mm per second, they are just as well suited for the POS as well as for shipping departments, office &amp; marketing applications, and for the generation of event &amp; transportation tickets. Depending on the model the print quality is 203 or 300 dpi.</p>\r\n<p>The DS210 and DA310 models convince with their low price tag and are ideal if you are looking for an entry-level model with the basic features of receipt and label printing. You connect the devices via USB 2.0 to the host or alternatively use the optional Bluetooth interface.</p>\r\n<p>If you are looking for even more options the DA220 and DA320 variants also offer RS-232, Ethernet, USB Host, and WLAN 802.11a/b/g/n. With 128 MB Flash and 64 MB DRAM, the DA210/DA220 Series printers have more than enough space for fonts, special characters, logos, graphics, and barcodes.</p>\r\n<p>The DA210/DA220 Series convinces with the factory-direct emulation of numerous common printer languages, including Line Mode, Eltron, Zebra, and Datamax. This way TSC makes it very easy for users to exchange old devices without having to alter the existing infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p>The printers come with a variety of sensors, including black marks, label gaps, and an open head. In addition, there is a spring-loaded roll holder that makes adding new receipt and label rolls very easy - interruptions during operation are kept to a minimum and the employees who operate the device are relaxed and satisfied.</p>','','TSC DA210/DA220 Series','Receipt and label printers with a top price-performance ratio','TSC_ DA210/DA220 Series'),(89,'en','','','','','','','',''),(86,'ro','DiMa01','','','','','DiMa01','','DiMa01'),(86,'en','','','','','','','',''),(87,'ro','DiMa02','','','','','DiMa02','','DiMa02'),(87,'en','','','','','','','',''),(88,'ro','DiMa03','','','','','DiMa03','','DiMa03'),(88,'en','','','','','','','',''),(89,'ro','DiMa04','','','','','DiMa04','','DiMa04'),(90,'ro','DiMa05','','','','','DiMa05','','DiMa05'),(90,'en','','','','','','','',''),(91,'en','xHACCP - software application for kitchens','','Temperature monitoring in freezers and refrigerators','<p>Basic functionalities</p>\r\n<p>1. Printing xHACCP labels for kitchen products</p>\r\n<p>2. Temperature monitoring of refrigerators, freezers, cold rooms and listing of temperature graphs</p>\r\n<p>3. Monitoring the validity terms of all products in the nomenclature</p>\r\n<p>4. Generating handover-management lists, between exchanges</p>\r\n<p>5. Generate reports of removal of expired products</p>\r\n<p>6. Generate production reports</p>\r\n<p>7. Scan function any type of QR code for the traceability of kitchen ingredients</p>\r\n<p>8. Associate photo image with each item received in stock</p>\r\n<p>9. Option to list allergens and/or caloric content for each product in the nomenclature (raw materials or finished products)</p>','','xHACCP - software application for kitchens','Temperature monitoring in freezers and refrigerators','xHACCP software application for_ kitchens'),(92,'ro','Etichete autoadezive 58x43, termice','<p>Etichete termice pentru cantar, contin 45 role / cutie , 1.000 etichete/rola.</p>\r\n<p>( pret /rola , se vinde la cutie de 45 role )</p>','Etichete termice pentru cantar, contin 45 role / cutie , 1.000 etichete/rola.\r\n( pret /rola , se vinde la cutie de 45 role )','<p>Etichete termice pentru cantar, contin 45 role / cutie , 1.000 etichete/rola.</p>\r\n<p>( pret /rola , se vinde la cutie de 45 role )</p>